[00:07.42]Let's make this fleeting moment last forever
{"让这转瞬即逝的瞬间成为永恒"}
[00:12.64]So, tell me what you're waiting for?
{"所以，你还在等待什么？"}
[00:14.90]I'm gonna keep it frozen here forever
{"我要将此刻永远封存"}
[00:20.34]There's no regretting anymore
{"不再有任何遗憾"}
[00:22.46]It's worth the wait, even so far away.
{"纵使相隔万里也值得等待"}
[00:26.02]I'm making the night mine until the day I die
{"我将独占这黑夜直至生命尽头"}
[00:29.76]No lights to brake when you're hanging by fate
{"当命运悬于一线时无需刹车灯"}
[00:33.33]You know what it feels like when you're dancing blind
{"你懂蒙眼起舞时的那种感觉"}
[00:37.30]All alone, just the beat inside my soul
{"孑然一身，唯有节拍在灵魂深处"}
[00:41.05]Take me home, where my dreams are made of gold
{"带我回家，那里有黄金铸就的梦"}
[00:44.82]In the zone where the beat is un-controlled.
{"在这节奏失控的领域里"}
[00:48.49]I know what it feels like
{"我明白那种感受"}
[00:50.36]Come on make me feel alive
{"来吧让我重获生机"}
[00:52.47]Feel alive
{"重获生机"}
[01:54.20]Meet me under shining lights
{"在聚光灯下与我相遇"}
[01:57.18]I've been waiting right here all my life
{"我此生都在此处等候"}
[02:01.25]Feelings you can't deny that you're living, open up your eyes
{"无法否认你正鲜活存在的感受，睁开双眼吧"}
[02:08.89]And I just wanna sink into your crazy laughter
{"我只想沉溺于你疯狂的笑声中"}
[02:12.76]Come on make me feel until the pain don't matter
{"来吧让我感受直至痛苦无关紧要"}
[02:16.51]Every second here makes my heart beat faster
{"此处的每一秒都让心跳加速"}
[02:20.33]Finally think I found what I'm chasing after
{"终于明白自己追寻的是什么"}
